{"id":"2be78d64f33cd0ea","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-regmono.md","title":"Regular functions are positive","display":"thm-regmono — Regular functions are positive","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-regmono","aliases":["27-thm-regmono"],"display":"thm-regmono — Regular functions are positive","depends_on":["[[27-df-regular]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-regmono"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-regmono</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regmono — Regular functions are positive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regular}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a>，其中后者指正的逐坐标非减函数类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Monotone}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Monotone}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §8.1，Definition 8.3，印刷 p.354／PDF p.378；已核对定义。此结论直接由类的定义推出。</li>\n<li>旧稿的反例以遗漏正性的另一种“regularity”定义为前提，不能用于原书 regular 类；现在恢复书中正性假设及相应结论。文件名保持不变以保留既有入口。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-regular]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Regular}_n$ 和 $\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]，其中后者指正的逐坐标非减函数类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Regular}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Monotone}_n.","display":true}],"bytes":864,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-546","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-regmono|thm-regmono — Regular functions are positive]]"}],"outgoing":["6ae49270bb9c0b4f"]}